msgid "Mornings."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:48
msgid ""
"A Morning section and view for tasks tagged \"Morning\", the mirror of "
"Tonight: Ctrl+Shift+M, context menu, drop target"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:49
msgid "Morning and Tonight appear in the sidebar only on days that use them"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:50
msgid "mo morning and mo add --morning"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:56
msgid "Your modifier key, and a test suite behind every feature."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:58
msgid ""
"Choose Ctrl, Alt or Super for every shortcut; the shortcuts overlay and "
"hints follow"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:59
msgid "Deleting and reordering tasks can now be undone with Ctrl+Z"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:60
msgid ""
"Editing a task scheduled at a time keeps its day; restored tasks no longer "
"duplicate subtask links"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:61
msgid ""
"mo: undone and rm find completed tasks, projects and tags support --json, "
"works without a session bus"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:67
msgid "Sync without a server, and tasks with a time."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:69
msgid ""
"Sync with nearby devices: direct, end-to-end encrypted sync over the local "
"network, linked once with a pairing code; works alongside Nextcloud"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dan_hart.Momentum.metainfo.xml.in.in:70
msgid ""
"Scheduled times and reminders in the task dialog; rows show the time and a "
"bell"
